      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/DiracGamma"],
     " instead supplies a slash in the fermion numerator."}], "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["FeynmanToSpinorProducts", BaseStyle -> "Link",
